<title>USA: Heinz says on track for double-digit growth.</title>
<headline>Heinz says on track for double-digit growth.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>H.J. Heinz Co said Monday that it is &quot;on track for double-digit earnings growth this year.&quot;</p>
<p>Heinz reported earnings for the second quarter ended October 30 of $0.47 a share on sales of $2.4 billion, compared with $0.42 a share on sales of $2.3 billion the previous second quarter.</p>
